{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"options":{"content":"","images":{},"widgets":{}},"periodicTable":false,"type":"multiple"},"hints":[{"content":"We can play around with the expressions in the answer choices to see if they are the same as $4(3j+(-4))-9$.","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the first expression is equivalent to $4(3j+(-4))-9$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{-12j-13}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 4(3j+(-4))-9  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-12j-13}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} (4)3j+(4)(-4)-9   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-12j-13}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 12j+(-16)-9   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-12j-13}   \u0026\\ne 12j-25 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's see if the second expression is equivalent to $4(3j+(-4))-9$.\n\n$\\qquad\n\\begin{align}\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4(-3j+4)-9}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} 4(3j+(-4))-9  \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4(-3j+4)-9}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=} (4)3j+(4)(-4)-9   \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4(-3j+4)-9}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}12j+(-16)-9 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{-4(-3j+4)-9}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}12j-25 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{(-4)(-3j)+(-4)4-9}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}12j-25 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{12j+(-16)-9}  \u0026\\stackrel{?}{=}12j-25 \\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n{12j-25}   \u0026= 12j-25\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\n \\end{align}$","images":{},"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expression is equivalent to $4(3j+(-4))-9$ :\n\n\n-  ${-4(-3j+4)-9} $\n","images":{},"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Which expressions are equivalent to $4(3j+(-4))-9$ ?**  \n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$-12j-13$","correct":false},{"content":"$-4(-3j+4)-9$","correct":true},{"isNoneOfTheAbove":true}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":true,"multipleSelect":true,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":false},"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
